# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Lovable's cloud editor writes LF; Windows checkouts were converting to CRLF,
# which made `npm run lint` report ~25,000 phantom prettier errors locally
# (every line of every file) while CI on Linux stayed clean. That noise buries
# real lint failures and tempts a whole-repo reformat that would collide with
# Lovable's own commits.
#
# Paired with prettier's "endOfLine": "auto" so neither side fights the other.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.lockb binary
